            "icon_background": "#ece5e1",
            "icon_color": "#389fbc",
            "title": "",
            "content": "<h4>Personal & Group Sessions</h4><p>Our services are designed to cater to both individual preferences and the dynamics of group therapy. Whether seeking personalized care or the shared experiences of group sessions, our therapy programs are tailored to support your journey to healing in a setting that feels right for you.</p>"
          }
        }
